    "text": "A stream of water flowing horizontally with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>m</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> gushes out of a tube of cross-sectional area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msup><mn>m</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math> and hits a vertical wall nearby. The force exerted on the wall by the impact of water (assuming it does not rebound) is",
